{"video":"2WD3lwWISnI","lines":[{"t":[0,1.7],"en":"Huh, where's the dog?"},{"t":[2,3.9],"en":"What dog? There's no dog here."},{"t":[4.5,5.6],"en":"Yeah, that dog left."},{"t":[8.5,9],"en":"Phoebe!"},{"t":[9.9,11.1],"en":"Phoebe, open up."},{"t":[12.1,13.5],"en":"There's no dog in here."},{"t":[15.2,17.9],"en":"Phoebe, we can hear the dog barking."},{"t":[18.3,19.9],"en":"No, that's just me coughing."},{"t":[25.6,27.6],"en":"Oh, good, there you are."},{"t":[27.6,30.1],"en":"Listen, um, I have a dog in my room."},{"t":[31.2,32.6],"en":"What is it doing here?"},{"t":[32.9,35.4],"en":"Well, I'm watching it for some friends who went out of town."},{"t":[35.7,35.9],"en":"Wait."},{"t":[38.1,40.1],"en":"Hello, my name is Clunkers."},{"t":[41.5,43.4],"en":"May I please stay with you nice people?"},{"t":[45.1,48.3],"en":"Oh, I wish you could stay here, but Chandler's allergic."},{"t":[49.3,50.9],"en":"Extremely allergic, okay?"},{"t":[51,54.1],"en":"If I am anywhere near a dog for more than five minutes,"},{"t":[54.1,56.6],"en":"my throat will just close up."},{"t":[57,60],"en":"That's odd, because this dog's been living here for the past three days."},{"t":[66.8,67.2],"en":"Really?"},{"t":[69.6,72.5],"en":"Chandler, if the dog has been here that long and you haven't had a reaction,"},{"t":[72.6,74.1],"en":"maybe you're not allergic to this dog."},{"t":[74.4,76],"en":"Well, it still has to go, right?"},{"t":[76.6,77],"en":"Why?"},{"t":[78.9,80.2],"en":"Okay, it's, um..."},{"t":[80.2,81.1],"en":"Don't do it!"},{"t":[83.9,84.8],"en":"Don't do what?"},{"t":[84.8,85.7],"en":"I have to!"},{"t":[86.2,86.6],"en":"Okay?"},{"t":[86.7,87.4],"en":"It's time!"},{"t":[92.8,94.1],"en":"Okay, I hate dogs."},{"t":[94.3,94.6],"en":"What?"},{"t":[94.6,94.8],"en":"What?"},{"t":[95.1,95.5],"en":"Crazy!"},{"t":[95.8,96.2],"en":"How are you?"},{"t":[96.2,96.5],"en":"Why?"},{"t":[97.9,98.5],"en":"Told you."},{"t":[104.1,106.8],"en":"They are needy, they are jumpy,"},{"t":[106.8,109],"en":"and you can't tell what they are thinking,"},{"t":[109,110.7],"en":"and that scares me a little bit."},{"t":[112.1,112.7],"en":"You're right."},{"t":[112.8,113.8],"en":"They are scary."},{"t":[114.3,117.5],"en":"Ah, she just ate a treat out of my hand!"},{"t":[119.8,120.4],"en":"Wait a minute."},{"t":[120.5,122.1],"en":"Do you not like all dogs?"},{"t":[122.2,123.3],"en":"I mean, not even puppies?"},{"t":[123.8,124.6],"en":"Is there a puppy here?"},{"t":[126.6,128],"en":"You don't like puppies?"},{"t":[128.7,129.8],"en":"Okay, you are new."},{"t":[133.9,135.4],"en":"Look, Chandler, I told you,"},{"t":[135.5,138],"en":"never tell anyone about this dog thing."},{"t":[138.6,140.3],"en":"It's like Ross not liking ice cream."},{"t":[142.1,143.3],"en":"You don't like ice cream?"},{"t":[143.4,144.5],"en":"It's too cold!"},{"t":[146.3,149.3],"en":"Okay, just the dogs make me a little uncomfortable."},{"t":[149.7,150.4],"en":"It hurts my pee."},{"t":[151.9,153.2],"en":"Now, I don't want to say this,"},{"t":[153.2,154.5],"en":"I don't want you guys to hate me,"},{"t":[154.7,155.4],"en":"but, uh,"},{"t":[155.7,158.4],"en":"I don't think I can be around that dog anymore, okay?"},{"t":[158.6,160.1],"en":"So, either the dog goes,"},{"t":[160.2,161.1],"en":"or I go."},{"t":[161.3,161.5],"en":"Huh."},{"t":[168.3,169.6],"en":"Oh, my God!"},{"t":[172,172.8],"en":"Okay, Phoebe."},{"t":[173.1,174.2],"en":"We should probably go back now."},{"t":[175.3,176.4],"en":"Please don't leave me."},{"t":[176.4,177.1],"en":"I'll be lonely."},{"t":[178.9,179.8],"en":"Stop it."},{"t":[180,180.4],"en":"Stop."},{"t":[181.1,182.1],"en":"Okay, let's go."},{"t":[182.4,183.5],"en":"Come on, we can be strong."},{"t":[183.6,184],"en":"Yeah, okay."},{"t":[187.7,189.5],"en":"Oh, my God, did you hear that?"},{"t":[189.5,190.4],"en":"She said Monica!"},{"t":[192.5,194],"en":"I can't leave her."},{"t":[194.3,195.2],"en":"You know, if you want,"},{"t":[195.4,196.7],"en":"we could sneak the dog back in"},{"t":[196.7,197.9],"en":"and Chandler wouldn't even know."},{"t":[198.3,199.3],"en":"That's not gonna work."},{"t":[199.4,201.3],"en":"I had that dog there for three days"},{"t":[201.3,202.7],"en":"and Chandler had no idea."},{"t":[202.8,203.9],"en":"He's not so smart."},{"t":[204.2,204.5],"en":"Hey."},{"t":[205.6,206.6],"en":"I didn't know either."},{"t":[206.9,208.2],"en":"Yeah, but you kind of knew"},{"t":[208.2,210.3],"en":"that something was going on,"},{"t":[210.4,210.8],"en":"didn't you?"},{"t":[212,212.7],"en":"Yeah, I knew."},{"t":[215.9,216.5],"en":"Hi, honey."},{"t":[217.6,219],"en":"Please, please, please,"},{"t":[219.1,219.9],"en":"don't be mad at me."},{"t":[220.4,220.6],"en":"What?"},{"t":[221.1,222.5],"en":"Why would she wait and see?"},{"t":[222.8,224],"en":"Maybe we will, maybe we won't."},{"t":[225.9,227.5],"en":"Okay, I went over to Ross's apartment"},{"t":[227.5,228.7],"en":"to bring back clunkers,"},{"t":[228.8,229.5],"en":"you know, for you."},{"t":[229.8,231.9],"en":"And I left the door open"},{"t":[231.9,234.5],"en":"and she must have gotten out."},{"t":[234.9,237],"en":"And I looked everywhere,"},{"t":[237.3,238.3],"en":"all over the apartment,"},{"t":[238.5,239.4],"en":"including the roof,"},{"t":[239.6,240.9],"en":"which, FYI, Ross,"},{"t":[241,241.7],"en":"one of your neighbors,"},{"t":[242.1,242.7],"en":"growing weed."},{"t":[244.9,246.4],"en":"I couldn't find him."},{"t":[246.6,250.9],"en":"And I am so, so, so sorry."},{"t":[251.2,253.2],"en":"But I do know"},{"t":[253.2,254.8],"en":"where we can all go ease the pain."},{"t":[258.3,259.6],"en":"We have good news."},{"t":[259.7,260.4],"en":"Look who's back!"},{"t":[260.8,261.3],"en":"Hey!"},{"t":[262.2,263.4],"en":"Look who's..."},{"t":[263.4,264.2],"en":"Oh, my God!"},{"t":[264.5,265.2],"en":"That's right."},{"t":[265.3,266.8],"en":"She came back all by herself."},{"t":[267.6,269.3],"en":"It's a Thanksgiving miracle!"},{"t":[271.8,274.4],"en":"It is so good to see you."},{"t":[274.6,275.7],"en":"Yeah, she came all the way back"},{"t":[275.7,276.8],"en":"from Ross's building."},{"t":[277.1,279],"en":"Oh, the things she must have seen!"},{"t":[280.4,282.3],"en":"And then she climbed up the fire escape"},{"t":[282.3,283.6],"en":"and she tapped on the window"},{"t":[283.6,285.2],"en":"with her teeny little paw"},{"t":[285.2,286.8],"en":"and then we ran to let her in."},{"t":[288.8,290.2],"en":"I went too far, didn't I?"},{"t":[291.6,292.8],"en":"When should I have stopped?"}]}
